msgctxt "3469"
msgid ""
"Offers minced chicken, burdock root, cabbage, and \n"
"three types of miso."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3541"
msgid ""
"Includes tasty fish roe, tofu, and Awaguchi soy sauce.\n"
"It's a savory, delicious cup of soup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3634"
msgid ""
"I think you'll agree that our tan tan noodles are a cut\n"
