"very high temperatures."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4481"
msgid "All the top athletes use this gear to stay in shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4534"
msgid ""
"Sells well because it stimulates the scalp and helps\n"
"hair stay healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4606"
